    {
      "id": "18227",
      "key": "SFCC-132",
      "summary": "PDP UI - Product Badges",
      "description": "As a\n Shopper,\nI want\n to see relevant badges on a product (such as Campaign, Runway, Exclusive, Online Exclusive, and VIC Exclusive),\nso that\n I can quickly identify the nature of a product when browsing its detail page.\nBadges are displayed on the PDP. A product can carry multiple badges simultaneously — when more than one applies, a defined priority hierarchy determines display order. Badges are clickable on the PDP and navigate the shopper to the relevant category PLP. Badge creation and assignment is covered in a separate user story \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-225\n.\nImage for reference (Figma is leading):",
