      "summary": "Global Footer UI",
      "description": "As a \nShopper, \n\n\nI want\n to see a consistent global footer on every page, \n\n\nso that\n I can access navigation links, contact information, legal content, and newsletter sign-up from anywhere on the site.\nReference image (Figma is leading):\nThe global footer is displayed at the bottom of every page across all storefronts and devices. It is CMS-managed via Contentful, allowing business users to update footer links and copy without a code deployment. The content of the footer (e.g. links) can be configured per storefront. Contentful integration is covered in a separate user story. This story covers the \nfooter shell, layout, and component structure only\n — footer link destinations, email sign-up Omneo integration, and Cookie Settings behaviour are covered in separate stories.\n\n\nLinks like “ACKNOWLEDGEMENT OF COUNTRY” are only relevant on the AU storefront, however, for the purpose of this user story we can include whatever placeholder links we want and can use the design as a first set of links.\nResponsive behaviour:\n There is a footer design for both desktop and mobile.",
