      "key": "SFCC-187",
      "summary": "PDP – Image Gallery Open State",
      "description": "As a\n Shopper,\nI want\n to expand the product gallery into a full-screen view,\nso that\n I can examine product images in greater detail before making a purchase decision.\nImage for reference (Figma leading):\n\n",
