      "description": "As a\n Shopper,\n\n\nI want\n to see clear product information when I land on a product detail page,\n\n\nso that \nI can quickly understand what the product is before deciding to buy.\nThis story covers the rendering of static product information on the PDP — fields sourced directly from the SFCC product record. It has no dependency on the Contentful integration, the colour/variation model, or inventory data. It is the most foundational PDP story and should be built first.\nReference image (Figma is leading): see attachment.\nIn Scope:\nBadges\nProduct name\nFull price in the currency of the active storefront (single/full price only)\nProduct description\n\"Model is…\" copy — model height and size worn\nStyle Code\nBreadcrumb navigation reflecting the product's category path (bottom of PDP)\nOut of scope (separate stories):\nWas/Now sale price display\nWishlist icon (CTAs story)\nColour swatches and variation selection\nSize selector and availability states\nAdd to Bag, Find in Boutique CTAs\nImage gallery\nAccordion content (Details & Care, Size & Fit, Shipping & Returns)\nContentful-sourced content",
