    "content": {
      "value": "Purpose\nThis page is a working document used to define which Business Manager (BM) roles need to be configured in Salesforce Commerce Cloud (SFCC).\nContext\nThe current Magento setup has 5 user roles. The functional requirements do not explicitly define which roles are needed in SFCC BM. This workshop aims to:\nIdentify all roles required in Business Manager\nM",
